Delphine, Mara,

The process map of our current transfer credit evaluation workflow is in the
shared drive (Transfer Eval > process-map-v1).

- 11 steps, from transcript receipt to posting on the degree audit.
- The bottleneck is step 6, course-by-course equivalency lookup.
- Steps 3 and 9 are manual re-keying between systems. Marked in amber.
- Swimlanes: front desk, evaluators, department reviewers, records.

Comments in the margin of the drive file are fine.

